From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Varagnat <emmanuel.varagnat@vates.tech>
Date: Tue, 30 Jun 2026 17:41:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] qcow2: disable AVX2/AVX512 optimizations

Undefine CONFIG_AVX2_OPT and CONFIG_AVX512BW_OPT for portability on
older toolchains, matching the existing old-component support tuning.
---
 include/qemu/config-host.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/qemu/config-host.h b/include/qemu/config-host.h
index 838d4bcc..a1972fc3 100644
--- a/include/qemu/config-host.h
+++ b/include/qemu/config-host.h
@@ -49,9 +49,9 @@
 
 #undef CONFIG_AUDIO_SNDIO
 
-#define CONFIG_AVX2_OPT
+#undef CONFIG_AVX2_OPT
 
-#define CONFIG_AVX512BW_OPT
+#undef CONFIG_AVX512BW_OPT
 
 #define CONFIG_BDRV_RO_WHITELIST 
 
